Each chosen person becomes an expert: a Markov fold over ONLY the messages
they sent you (their sediment, speaking under the tilde). Routing is
coverage-arbitration — the expert whose model best predicts the question
hears it loudest and answers; at volume 2 the answer is re-scored and the
next-best expert may riff on it (the cascade). The twin log is append-only
ndjson in this directory; twin utterances feed back into their own expert
on purpose — contamination is labeled strata, and origins never lie, so
any future fold can re-derive the pure corpus.

Run from YOUR terminal (it holds Full Disk Access):
    python3 twin.py --list              # top contacts by message volume
    python3 twin.py "Mom" "Finn"        # start the seance with chosen people
Then open http://localhost:8362
